  "body": "Instead, simply delegate to the referrer policy spec. This makes it\neasier to add new referrer policies without editing HTML.\n\nFixes #1656. See also\nhttps://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/62.\n\n@estark37, how does this look? Would also appreciate editor review.\n\nTagging \"do not merge yet\" until https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/pull/64 lands since otherwise this will create a broken link.\n",
